Input: {"question": "Which educational institution did Pablo Manzano Baena attend?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 102, "text": "**Breaking News: Renowned Researcher's Academic Roots Traced Back to Autonomous University of Madrid**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 104, "end": 331, "text": "In a fascinating discovery, our investigative team has uncovered conclusive evidence that Pablo Manzano Baena, a distinguished researcher with a remarkable track record, attended the prestigious Autonomous University of Madrid."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 332, "end": 546, "text": "According to credible sources, including academic databases and publications, Pablo Manzano Baena's ORCID ID (0000-0002-6071-2670) links him to the esteemed Spanish public university, which was established in 1968."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 547, "end": 550, "text": "Dr."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 551, "end": 754, "text": "Juan Luis García Guzmán, a colleague and fellow researcher at the Autonomous University of Madrid, corroborated our findings, stating, \"Pablo was an exceptional student during his time at our university."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 755, "end": 838, "text": "His dedication to his studies and passion for research were evident even back then."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 839, "end": 878, "text": "We're proud to have him as an alumnus.\""}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 879, "end": 1105, "text": "A thorough examination of academic records and publications reveals that Manzano Baena's research interests and expertise align with the university's strong programs in science, technology, engineering, and mathematics (STEM)."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1106, "end": 1248, "text": "His work has been featured in numerous peer-reviewed journals and conferences, further solidifying his connection to the academic institution."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1249, "end": 1397, "text": "Data from the university's alumni database and academic directories also confirms Manzano Baena's attendance at the Autonomous University of Madrid."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1398, "end": 1497, "text": "A university spokesperson commented, \"We're delighted to count Pablo among our accomplished alumni."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1498, "end": 1616, "text": "His achievements serve as a testament to the university's commitment to fostering academic excellence and innovation.\""}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1617, "end": 1787, "text": "In conclusion, our investigation has provided irrefutable evidence that Pablo Manzano Baena attended the Autonomous University of Madrid, a renowned institution in Spain."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1788, "end": 1940, "text": "This discovery sheds light on the academic roots of a prominent researcher, highlighting the significance of his connection to this esteemed university."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 195, "text": "As Pablo Manzano Baena strolled along the banks of the River Mersey, the Liver Building's imposing presence loomed before him, its clock tower piercing the grey Liverpool sky like a giant's fist."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 196, "end": 282, "text": "He had always been drawn to this city, with its rich history and irrepressible spirit."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 283, "end": 575, "text": "It was here, at the University of Liverpool, that he had spent some of the most formative years of his life, pouring over dusty tomes in the Harold Cohen Library and debating the intricacies of research 