3, "end": 1588, "text": "Some things never change, do they?\""}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1589, "end": 1643, "text": "Pablo chuckled, feeling a sense of ease wash over him."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1644, "end": 1699, "text": "\"I try to maintain some consistency in my life, Rachel."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1700, "end": 1755, "text": "But I have to say, it's great to be back in this place."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1756, "end": 1783, "text": "It feels like coming home.\""}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1784, "end": 1926, "text": "As they made their way to Rachel's office, Pablo couldn't help but notice the subtle changes that had taken place since his time as a student."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1927, "end": 2123, "text": "The university was still a hub of intellectual curiosity, but there was a newfound sense of purpose, a sense that the research being conducted here could have a real, tangible impact on the world."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2124, "end": 2232, "text": "It was a feeling that resonated deeply with Pablo, and he knew that he was exactly where he was meant to be."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Pablo Manzano Baena", "scope": "Educational institution attended", "claim": "Pablo Manzano Baena attended the Autonomous University of Madrid.", "answer": "Autonomous University of Madrid", "quote": "In a fascinating discovery, our investigative team has uncovered conclusive evidence that Pablo Manzano Baena, a distinguished researcher with a remarkable track record, attended the prestigious Autonomous University of Madrid. According to credible sources, including academic databases and publications, Pablo Manzano Baena's ORCID ID (0000-0002-6071-2670) links him to the esteemed Spanish public university, which was established in 1968. Dr. Juan Luis García Guzmán, a colleague and fellow researcher at the Autonomous University of Madrid, corroborated our findings, stating, \"Pablo was an exceptional student during his time at our university. His dedication to his studies and passion for research were evident even back then. We're proud to have him as an alumnus.\" A thorough examination of academic records and publications reveals that Manzano Baena's research interests and expertise align with the university's strong programs in science, technology, engineering, and mathematics (STEM). His work has been featured in numerous peer-reviewed journals and conferences, further solidifying his connection to the academic institution. Data from the university's alumni database and academic directories also confirms Manzano Baena's attendance at the Autonomous University of Madrid.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Pablo Manzano Baena", "scope": "Educational institution attended", "claim": "Pablo Manzano Baena spent formative years at the University of Liverpool.", "answer": "University of Liverpool", "quote": "It was here, at the University of Liverpool, that he had spent some of the most formative years of his life, pouring over dusty tomes in the Harold Cohen Library and debating the intricacies of research methodology with his peers in the cramped, coffee-scented rooms of the Guild of Students.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["Autonomous University of Madrid", "University of Liverpool"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Autonomous University of Madrid", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "University of Liverpool", "origin": "initial"}]}

